&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:4px;line-height:1.35&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot; color=&quot;#0F172A&quot;&gt;~/.config/kargo-demo/pat&lt;/font&gt; → Secret gitops-repo (Kargo pushes with it)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot; color=&quot;#0F172A&quot;&gt;~/.config/agentgateway/config.yaml&lt;/font&gt; → Secret azure (the model key)&lt;br&gt;Both are piped into the cluster by the scripts.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=11;spacingRight=9;spacingTop=8;fontSize=11;fontColor=#475569;" vertex="1" parent="setup-grp-90"><mxGeometry x="905" y="45" width="450" height="95" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="setup-card-94" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;color:#1E293B&quot;&gt;One release, end to end&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:4px;line-height:1.35&quot;&gt;Tag → image → Warehouse sees it → Freight → dev promotes itself: render, commit to the stage branch, Argo CD syncs, pods roll. Then you promote to prod. Promote mcp-server before the agents.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=11;spacingRight=9;spacingTop=8;fontSize=11;fontColor=#475569;" vertex="1" parent="setup-grp-90"><mxGeometry x="1375" y="45" width="450" height="95" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="setup-e-95" value="lists tags&lt;br&gt;every minute" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;strokeColor=#2563EB;strokeWidth=1.5;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;endSize=7;fontSize=10;fontColor=#334155;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=8;exitX=0.125;exitY=1;entryX=0.911;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="setup-card-17" target="setup-card-25"><mxG